{"seq":40,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2505"},"reason":"The body said Raup and Sepkoski (Science, 1982) found five intervals of mass extinction. Their abstract reports four statistically distinct marine mass extinctions (end-Ordovician, Permian, Triassic, Cretaceous) plus a fifth, Devonian event that stands out but was not statistically significant in their data. Sentence corrected in all three languages; the 'Big Five' answer is unchanged.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID:17788674%20AND%20SRC:MED&resultType=core&format=json"},{"url":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/science/article/mass-extinction"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",108],["-","five"],["+","four"],["=",19],["-","rate."],["+","rate,"],["=",1],["+","and a fifth, in the Late Devonian, that stood out less sharply. "],["=",839]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",106],["-","fünf"],["+","vier"],["=",21],["-","stieg."],["+","stieg,"],["=",1],["+","und einen fünften im Oberdevon, der weniger deutlich hervortrat. "],["=",797]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",92],["-","пять"],["+","четыре"],["=",1],["-","интервалов,"],["+","интервала,"],["=",17],["-","уровня."],["+","уровня,"],["=",1],["+","и пятый, в позднем девоне, выделявшийся не так резко. "],["=",737]]}],"hash":"1c7f0d085079","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"2891e0f4f0d59ee48b9eddca96233e827af6507bfe59282c213c1d32a7f4c465"},
